OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to object to major solar
OL,4,Afarm plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has agreed to formally object
OL,7,Fto plans for a huge solar farm on
OL,8,FLincolnshire farmland.
OL,10,FMeridian Solar Farm Limited is seeking
OL,11,Fpermission for a 40-year development
OL,12,Fconsent order to build a solar farm on
OL,13,Fabout 2,700 acres (1,092 hectares) of
OL,14,Fland near Spalding.
OL,16,FAt a Lincolnshire County Council
OL,17,Fmeeting on Monday, councillors
OL,18,Fdescribed the plans as a "large-scale
OL,19,Findustrialisation" of the countryside
OL,20,Fand an example of "greed".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
