OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to object to major solar
OL,4,Afarm plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, David Vernon, from Meridian
OL,7,FSolar Farm Limited, said the project
OL,8,Fwould "provide domestic, renewable
OL,9,Fenergy at a time when it is most
OL,10,Fneeded".
